{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","section":{"25":{"eng-name":"Chapters on Hajj Rituals","ara-name":"كتاب المناسك"}},"section_detail":{"25":{"hadithnumber_first":2882,"hadithnumber_last":3119,"arabicnumber_first":2882,"arabicnumber_last":3119}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3035,"arabicnumber":3035,"text":"Rapporté par Qudamah bin ‘Abdullah Al-‘Amiri : J’ai vu le Prophète (ﷺ) lancer les cailloux à la stèle, le jour du sacrifice, depuis le dos de sa chamelle rousse, sans frapper personne, ni repousser, ni demander à quelqu’un de s’écarter","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Hasan Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":25,"hadith":154},"chapter":{"id":66,"ara-name":"باب رَمْىِ الْجِمَارِ رَاكِبًا","eng-name":"Stoning the pillars while riding","isFirstHadith":false}}]}